[{:adr/authoritative_for ["fleet demo-page architecture rule (compliance claims computed by the actor's own .cljc at build time, never hand-typed)" "cloud-itonami flagship (isic-6399/isic-6310) governed-op coverage and operator-path state as of 2026-07-12" "cloud-itonami public discovery surface (org profile, cloud-itonami.github.io registry-generated catalog)"], :adr/supersedes [], :adr/superseded_by [], :adr/topic "cloud-itonami-flagship-maturity-sprint", :adr/related ["adr-2607121700-cloud-itonami-isic-6399-meta-jobsearch-venture" "cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-6399 docs/adr/0002-posting-correction.md" "cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami.github.io docs/adr/0001-catalog-surface.md"], :adr/status "accepted", :adr/id "adr-2607122300-cloud-itonami-flagship-maturity-sprint", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/body "# ADR-2607122300: flagship maturity sprint — Indeed/kaonavi replacements to operable, discoverable businesses\n\n**Status**: accepted\n**Date**: 2026-07-12\n**Deciders**: Jun Kawasaki (+ Claude, /loop 常設承認のうえ実行)\n\n## Context\n\nFollowing ADR-2607121700 (the isic-6399 meta-job-search venture), the\nowner directed a standing loop: \"実際に indeed 置き換え, kaonavi\n置き換えの成熟度を向上, uiux も公開, business として成立するように\n進めて\". This ADR records what that sprint (12 iterations, 2026-07-12)\nchanged and the decisions that stick.\n\n## Decisions and outcomes\n\n### 1. Demo pages are build-time actor executions, not mockups\n\nBoth flagship demo pages (GitHub Pages) are generated by nbb scripts\nthat run the FULL OperationActor StateGraph — advisor → governor →\nphase gate → approval interrupts — and render the post-run Store, the\nreal refusal verdicts and the append-only ledger those runs wrote.\nThis is the sticking architectural rule for fleet demo pages: **a\npublic page's compliance claims must be computed by the actor's own\n`.cljc` at build time, never hand-typed.** In-browser interactivity is\nscittle-run ClojureScript; every page has a headless nbb DOM-stub\nharness plus real-browser (headless Chromium --dump-dom) verification.\n\n### 2. Governed-op coverage extended where the law names the gap\n\n- isic-6399 `:posting/correct` (repo ADR-0002): 職業安定法5条の4 の\n  訂正義務. Same content gates as a fresh publication + a\n  posting-not-live guard; corrections repeat with numbered records.\n- isic-6310 `:assignment/propose`: kaonavi 配置転換 gap. HRBP-only\n  RBAC, fairness gate refuses protected-attribute grounds, always\n  human-approved, from/to+approver queryable (`:apply-assignment`).\n- isic-6310 `talent.sim` fixed to pass `:phase 3` explicitly (the\n  conservative default-phase change had silently broken its\n  documented narrative).\n- isic-6399 facts: 6 jurisdictions (added FRA: Code du travail\n  L5331-1/L1132-1 + CPI L341-1 ff.; KOR: 채용절차법4조 +\n  남녀고용평등법7조 + 저작권법91–98조), all with real consent\n  sub-citations.\n\n### 3. Operator path is real, and validated\n\n`docs/operator-quickstart.md` per repo; isic-6399's generator takes an\noperator `postings.edn` and builds THEIR governed board (holds with\nreal verdicts). The standalone layout (fresh shallow clones +\n`npm install nbb`) was reproduced from scratch and works as\ndocumented. Freshness automation: nightly GitHub Actions regeneration\nin both isic-6399 (的確表示 as a scheduler) and the catalog repo,\ncommit-only-on-change, both runs verified green.\n\n### 4. Public discovery surface\n\n- Org landing: github.com/cloud-itonami (`.github` repo profile).\n- Fleet catalog: <https://cloud-itonami.github.io/> — generated from\n  kotoba-lang/industry's registry.edn (144 implemented / 646 entries,\n  honest maturity breakdown), so the marketplace face cannot drift\n  from the SSoT. Catalog repo ADR-0001 defers itonami.cloud cockpit\n  integration: if that cockpit grows a marketplace surface it must\n  CONSUME the same registry.\n- Registry entries for 6310/6399 carry `:demo` URLs and op-coverage\n  comments.\n\n### 5. Upstream fixes shipped along the way (fleet-wide effect)\n\n- kotoba-lang/langchain 9f4453d3: `langchain.db` unloadable under nbb\n  (SCI fails on a quoted `$` inside an `or` expansion).\n- kotoba-lang/langchain 0f966d06: `langchain.runnable`/`model`\n  unloadable under nbb (cljs concrete map types in extend-protocol;\n  nbb branch extends Keyword + :default with manual map/fn dispatch).\n  These two are what made \"run the actor at page build\" possible.\n- kotoba-lang/html f26595df: RAWTEXT refactor regression — `<script>`/\n  `<style>` children of shape `[:hiccup/raw ...]` rendered as vector\n  literals, breaking css/style-node and every generated page built\n  against html main; fixed by unwrapping raw children in the RAWTEXT\n  branch (breakout guard applies to the payload).\n- kotoba-lang/industry: implemented-count test reconciled to 144 after\n  a three-way promotion race (5820/6201/6202), attribution verified by\n  diffing implemented-id sets against the 141-era commit.\n\nAll landed via server-side merges with west pins advanced by\nsingle-entry API commits per `repos.edn :manifest-workflow`.\n\n## Consequences\n\n- Both replacements now have: full governed-op coverage with green\n  suites (6399: 49 tests/225 assertions; 6310: 32/118), live verified\n  demos, validated fork-to-production paths, concrete pricing/unit-\n  economics/funnel docs, and a discoverable catalog → demo → fork\n  funnel that actually exists end-to-end.\n- Not done (known): real feed/search-index integrations and 6310\n  real-data seeding remain operator-side; itonami.cloud marketplace\n  surface awaits an owner-approved cockpit ADR; jurisdiction catalogs\n  are 6 of ~194.\n\n## References\n\n- ADR-2607121700 (venture placement); cloud-itonami-isic-6399 ADR-0002;\n  cloud-itonami.github.io ADR-0001.\n- Repos: cloud-itonami/{cloud-itonami-isic-6399, cloud-itonami-isic-6310,\n  .github, cloud-itonami.github.io}; kotoba-lang/{langchain, html,\n  industry}.", :adr/deciders ["Jun Kawasaki"], :adr/date "2026-07-12", :adr/amends [], :db/id -1, :adr/decision-summary "{:directive \"実際に indeed 置き換え, kaonavi 置き換えの成熟度を向上, uiux も公開, business として成立するように (owner /loop, 12 iterations 2026-07-12)\", :sticking-rule \"fleet demo pages are build-time actor executions: nbb generator runs the full OperationActor StateGraph and renders post-run store + real verdicts + real ledger; scittle for in-browser cljs; headless DOM-stub harness + headless-chromium verification\", :ops-added {:isic-6399 \":posting/correct (訂正, 職安法5条の4; same content gates as publish + posting-not-live guard; corrections repeat with numbered records; repo ADR-0002)\", :isic-6310 \":assignment/propose (配置転換; HRBP-only RBAC, fairness gate, always human, from/to+approver queryable) + sim :phase 3 fix\"}, :jurisdictions \"6399 facts 4->6 (+FRA Code du travail L5331-1/L1132-1 + CPI L341-1ff; +KOR 채용절차법4조 + 남녀고용평등법7조 + 저작권법91-98조), all six with real consent sub-citations\", :operator-path {:quickstarts :both, :own-data-generator \"6399 generate.cljs postings.edn -> operator's governed board\", :standalone-validated true, :freshness-automation \"nightly regenerate workflows (6399 board + fleet catalog), commit-on-change, runs verified green\"}, :public-surface {:org-profile \"github.com/cloud-itonami (.github repo)\", :catalog \"https://cloud-itonami.github.io/ generated from kotoba-lang/industry registry.edn (144 implemented / 646, honest maturity breakdown); itonami.cloud cockpit integration deferred -- must consume the same registry\"}, :upstream-fixes [\"langchain 9f4453d3 (db: quoted $ in or-expansion, nbb-unloadable)\" \"langchain 0f966d06 (runnable/model: SCI-safe protocol extension branch)\" \"html f26595df (RAWTEXT [:hiccup/raw] unwrap regression)\" \"industry implemented-count reconciliation to 144 after 3-way promotion race\"], :test-state {:isic-6399 \"49 tests / 225 assertions\", :isic-6310 \"32 tests / 118 assertions\"}, :known-not-done [:real-feed-and-index-integrations :6310-real-data-seeding :itonami-cloud-marketplace-adr :jurisdictions-beyond-6]}", :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "ADR-2607122300: flagship maturity sprint — Indeed/kaonavi replacements to operable, discoverable businesses", :adr/source-format "edn"}]